# Copy to .env and adjust. Secrets are read from the environment only and never
# committed (.env is gitignored).

# GitHub token used to read the PR and post the review comment. On a GitHub
# Action the workflow supplies this automatically; set it only for a local run.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...

# --- Hosted-LLM API key (only if a repo reviews with a hosted provider) ------
# The default provider is a free, local, keyless Ollama, so NO key is needed to
# start. Set a key only when shiva.config.yml routes a repo to a hosted provider
# (llm.provider or llm_by_repo). Put the raw key as the value — the reviewer
# adds the right header (Bearer for most, x-api-key for Anthropic). The local
# providers (ollama, lmstudio, vllm) need no key.
#
# SHIVA_LLM_API_KEY=...
